# identity's invites (core/modules/identity/README.md "Invites", gamma-p6-020): an Owner's session
# for the workspace's invites (identity.invite); any session for the caller's own invitations. Put
# your workspaceId and an `inviteId` the list answers in http-client.private.env.json. A write sends
# the cookie, so it sends Origin too. The revoke is @Idempotent(): its Idempotency-Key is an example
# UUID; another one asks again. An invite mail goes through the app-mail port: run on the fake.

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/identity/invites: the invites not accepted, open, expired or revoked, latest expiry first
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/identity/invites
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/identity/invites: invites an email as Owner or Member for 7 days and mails it; an expired or revoked invite is renewed; 201 with mail sent, skipped or failed; 409 invite_exists, 409 already_member, 400 identity_input_invalid (email), 400 validation_failed (role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/identity/invites
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}

{ "email": "new.member@example.test", "role": "Member" }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/identity/invites/{id}/revoke: revokes an open or expired invite, answered with it; a revoked one answers unchanged; 404 invite_not_found, 409 invite_accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/identity/invites/{{inviteId}}/revoke
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000006020

### GET /v1/invitations: the open invites to the caller's own email, with the workspace's name, the role, the inviter and the expiry
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/invitations
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### POST /v1/invitations/{id}/accept: accepts the caller's own open invite, answered with the workspace's id and slug; an accepted one answers the same; 404 invite_not_found
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/invitations/{{inviteId}}/accept
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
